  "extra_prompt": "You are booking for a travel agency. Ask about departure city, dates, destination, travellers, budget, and any preferences (airline, class, hotel standard). Ask about passports, visas, and travel insurance. Quote prices only from the reference answers, and say the final price is confirmed at booking. Do not promise prices that are not in the reference answers as live availability changes.",
  "kb": [
    {
      "q": "Do you charge a service fee?",
      "a": "{price_note} Some bookings have no fee, while complex itineraries may attract one. We confirm any fee before you pay.",
      "keywords": "fee,cost,price,service",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Can you beat online prices?",
      "a": "We compare options for you, and our support during changes adds value. Prices depend on the supplier and dates, so we cannot promise to beat every online fare.",
      "keywords": "cheaper,online price,beat",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you book flights only?",
      "a": "Yes, we can book flights only. Packages can sometimes give better value, so ask us to compare both.",
      "keywords": "flights only",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you book cruises?",
      "a": "Yes, we can book cruises with [cruise lines you work with]. A cruise deposit is taken at booking, as listed on your quote.",
      "keywords": "book,cruises",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do corporate travel?",
      "a": "Yes, we handle corporate travel with reporting and help with your travel policy. Corporate management is charged as listed on your quote.",
      "keywords": "corporate,business",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you arrange travel insurance?",
      "a": "Yes, we can arrange travel insurance through [insurer or provider]. It is charged per person, and we explain what it covers before you buy.",
      "keywords": "insurance",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you help with visas?",
      "a": "Yes, we explain visa requirements and help with paperwork. Visa processing times and fees are set by the government, so please check them with us before you travel.",
      "keywords": "visa",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do honeymoons?",
      "a": "Yes, we plan honeymoons and romantic trips. Tell us your budget, dates and what you enjoy, and we will send options.",
      "keywords": "honeymoon,romantic",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do group travel?",
      "a": "Yes, we book group, family and school travel. Tell us the group size and dates early so we can secure availability.",
      "keywords": "group",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you book Disney and theme park holidays?",
      "a": "Yes, we book Disney and theme park holidays. Tell us your park tickets, accommodation and travel dates when you enquire.",
      "keywords": "book,disney,theme,park",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "What if my flight is cancelled?",
      "a": "We support you during travel disruptions by helping you find options with the airline. Please contact us as soon as you hear about the change.",
      "keywords": "flight,cancelled",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you offer payment plans?",
      "a": "{payment_note} We confirm any instalment dates before you pay.",
      "keywords": "payment plan,instalment",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "What is your cancellation policy?",
      "a": "Cancellation terms depend on the supplier, so we confirm the terms for your booking before you pay. Any change or reissue fee is listed on your quote.",
      "keywords": "cancel,cancellation",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you have an after-hours line?",
      "a": "{afterhours_note} Travellers already on a trip can call us for urgent help.",
      "keywords": "after hours,emergency",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "How do I get a quote?",
      "a": "Tell us your departure city, dates, destination and the number of travellers. We will send you options and a quote.",
      "keywords": "quote,how",
      "priority": 9
    }
  ],
